  "text": "ABA · Module 1 Supplemental Readings Two readings on what applied behavior analysis is, what it is not, and how its methods are used in classrooms. Reading note:  Reading 1 is the  Applied Behavior Analysis  entry from TARGET: Texas Guide for Effective Teaching (Texas Statewide Leadership for Autism, 2009). Reading 2 is Trump, Pennington, Travers, Ringdahl, Whiteside and Ayres, \"Applied Behavior Analysis in Special Education: Misconceptions and Guidelines for Use,\"  TEACHING Exceptional Children , 2018. Reference lists and resource links are kept in collapsible sections and are not read aloud.",
